  "assertion": "neurotransmitters convey signals across synapses by diffusing through the synaptic cleft and binding to specific receptors on the postsynaptic membrane as chemical messengers via diffusion and binding, which is incoherent because neurotransmitters are a type of chemical messenger rather than an entity that conveys signals to another distinct class of chemical messengers in this manner."
